<section class="final-cta"><p class="eyebrow eyebrow-light">Independent problem validation</p><h2>Know whether the problem deserves a solution before you build it.</h2><p>The standard project includes target definition, approximately 30–40 suitable prospects for client approval, recruitment, 20 interviews, transcripts, evidence analysis, a written report, recommended changes and a BUILD, CHANGE or KILL recommendation.</p><p>Fixed price: €2,900 + VAT. Typical timeline: approximately 2–4 weeks. Larger and multi-segment projects can be scoped separately.</p><a class="button button-light" href="/#contact">Submit your idea</a></section>
